shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"jXrhIVKcJ-upvglUmfC1pA","review_id":"RejcP3ngcfBELInFQaJO2A","date":"2013-01-25T02:03:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.931732177734375,"text_excerpt":"Great 24 hour diner on Bourbon. Stop in for cheap eats - omelets, hash browns, burgers, pork chops, you name it, all served up from the giant grill behind the counter. My favorite was the friend egg sandwich (a steal at 4 bucks) but my friend got the Special Club on the recommendation of one of the locals and loved it. Staff is friendly and has a good sense of humor - we stopped here more than once for late night eats during our visit and were never disappointed."},{"business_id":"jXrhIVKcJ-upvglUmfC1pA","review_id":"ZTHZO3GmCzXghhCyM-e2UQ","date":"2011-09-14T22:55:19","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9316211938858032,"text_excerpt":"This place has always been a oasis in a sea of drunkenness that is Bourbon St. If you're in the mood for a late night diner, Clover Grill is the place to go. I recommend sitting at the bar because the staff there are really friendly to speak to. Me, my wife, and her friend had a great time there after a night in the Quarter. The burgers were juicy and delicious and any diner that serves tots is a big plus. The milkshakes are hand-spun and absolutely wonderful. Overall, its definitely a place to check out for good late night eats."},{"business_id":"jXrhIVKcJ-upvglUmfC1pA","review_id":"LTPZBb9-iwRlH693V1Fe_Q","date":"2013-03-20T02:58:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9305965900421143,"text_excerpt":"Clover Grill has been one of my favorite late night haunts since I was in college and drinking on Bourbon. The food is consistently greasy diner and yummy and the service is friendly despite the warnings otherwise on the menu. I've never been disappointed with the food there. It's cheap yummy goodness and always open, you can't beat that!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"jXrhIVKcJ-upvglUmfC1pA","photo_id":"3Yu2LRW2lHumjKSwWgts8A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/3Yu2LRW2lHumjKSwWgts8A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8995312452316284},{"business_id":"jXrhIVKcJ-upvglUmfC1pA","photo_id":"IS8m4LbdzkSyHORgRoXHxw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/IS8m4LbdzkSyHORgRoXHxw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8629468679428101},{"business_id":"jXrhIVKcJ-upvglUmfC1pA","photo_id":"SImZ6qRODkj9ME13bgSIwg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/SImZ6qRODkj9ME13bgSIwg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8550403714179993},{"business_id":"jXrhIVKcJ-upvglUmfC1pA","photo_id":"O410MnnpWoeZ1Xoi0L-Ehg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/O410MnnpWoeZ1Xoi0L-Ehg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8369622230529785},{"business_id":"jXrhIVKcJ-upvglUmfC1pA","photo_id":"8k7M98AXhdlVCF68E5PW6w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/8k7M98AXhdlVCF68E5PW6w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.767129123210907}]},"notebook_case":null}
